Remove the OpenRouter provider (PATCH_OUT_OPENROUTER, default 1).

Guards vendored charm.land/fantasy/providers/openrouter New() with an error:
a cloud LLM gateway (https://openrouter.ai/api/v1, the forced base URL) is
out-of-design for the local-model-first setup. No SDK weight is involved, so
this is a minimal reversible guard rather than an import cut; a configured
openrouter-typed provider fails with an explicit error. See
tasks/reference/dependency-network-audit.md D9.

